  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OPDE-Youth Economic Empowerment in BJM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project contribute to that youth in Bujumbura Rural areas are motivated, supported and educated in various skills to increase their livelihoods and cash revenues to become independent and economic actors in their societies. Through formal and informal education, youth will be trained in entrepreneurship linked to marked needs, food security and embracing new ways of generating income, for instance by transforming produces, improved quality and value chain development.</narrative>
  </description>
